    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GET YOKED is a <strong>Roguelike</strong>, <strong>Deckbuilder</strong> game about becoming an <strong>ABSOLUTE UNIT</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/f3f2670e67b883f80c5d59116358f501.poster.avif?t=1749573562\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/f3f2670e67b883f80c5d59116358f501.webm?t=1749573562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/f3f2670e67b883f80c5d59116358f501.mp4?t=1749573562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SWOLATRO: The world's first Comedy Deckbuilder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think Balatro meets Slay the Spire, but with gains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A storytelling machine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you skip helping your mom so that you can keep working your glutes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/7dbe7dbba1835f42111e2737be1f5301.poster.avif?t=1749573562\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/7dbe7dbba1835f42111e2737be1f5301.webm?t=1749573562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/7dbe7dbba1835f42111e2737be1f5301.mp4?t=1749573562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, and sculpt your body to win competitions. Reach the minimum gains required to win.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play workout cards to get <strong>Gains</strong>, e.g., play Arms to grow those guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't push too hard \u2014 too much <strong>Fatigue</strong> can lead to <strong>Injury</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play rest and supplement cards to increase your <strong>Gains</strong> or decrease muscle <strong>Fatigue</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Really into your Glutes? No problem become a Glutes purist and get those buns hun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey to <strong>Gains</strong>-Town is difficult, make smart decisions on your journey to become an <strong>ABSOLUTE UNIT</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play four different starting bodybuilders. Each with their own deck and playstyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The definitive Bodybuilder Roguelike experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization: complete competitions and unlock shorts, tattoos, hairstyles, shoes, and gloves to personalize your Bodybuilders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth campaign mode complete with harder difficulties, as well daily, endless, challenge and seeded runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/55f7b416489296b15dc1136896aeccc7.poster.avif?t=1749573562\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/55f7b416489296b15dc1136896aeccc7.webm?t=1749573562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/55f7b416489296b15dc1136896aeccc7.mp4?t=1749573562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
